            "review_title": "Review at Swan Cafe & Bakery",
            "review_text": "Irina Shershneva\nPhu Quoc Island, Vietnam16 contributions\n0\nA cozy cafe to enjoy relaxing alone.\nApr 2019 • Solo\nThe cafe has much space on each of the floors(3 floor or more), you will not have to search for a place for a long time to reading or working. actually I used to always sit on the ground floor. Always friendly staff, and can to watch a passersby from the window.\nAnd of course coffee, I ordered latte and americano, with or without milk, the coffee is very tasty. I tried almost all the pastries: tart with mango, tart with blueberries, chocolate chip bun or bun with nuts, everything is very tasty - I recommend it as a breakfast place, like it was for me)\nRead more\nWritten April 9, 2019\nSwan cafe & Bakery\nThank you so much ^^\nWritten April 10, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
